<div id="kugou-section" class="flex flex-col gap-space-lg" style="display: none">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-sm">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">酷狗账号与歌单</h2>
      <p id="kugou-status" class="mt-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
        检查登录状态…
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
      <button
        type="button"
        id="kugou-refresh"
        class="rounded-lg bg-surface-container px-space-md py-1.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high"
      >
        刷新
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        id="kugou-logout"
        class="rounded-lg border border-error/40 px-space-md py-1.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-error hover:bg-error/10"
      >
        退出酷狗
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-space-lg lg:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-lg lg:col-span-5">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-container-high bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">扫码登录</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          用手机酷狗 App 扫描二维码，确认后登录态只保存在服务器数据卷里，不下发浏览器。
        </p>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="kugou-qr-start"
          class="mt-space-md rounded-lg bg-primary px-space-lg py-2 font-label-md text-label-md text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-container"
        >
          生成登录二维码
        </button>
        <div id="kugou-qr-panel" class="mt-space-md flex flex-col items-center gap-2" style="display: none">
          <img id="kugou-qr-image" alt="酷狗登录二维码" class="h-44 w-44 rounded bg-white p-2 shadow-sm" />
          <p id="kugou-qr-message" class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant" role="status"></p>
          <a
            id="kugou-qr-link"
            class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary underline underline-offset-4"
            href="#"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            在酷狗打开
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-container-high bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">我的歌单</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          点「设为站内歌单」切换 `/reading/` 展示的歌单；默认是 `maotouying`。
        </p>
        <div id="kugou-playlists" class="mt-space-sm flex flex-col gap-2"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-lg lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-container-high bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">
            当前站内歌单{' '}
            <span id="kugou-playlist-name" class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant"></span>
          </h3>
          <span id="kugou-track-count" class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant"></span>
        </div>
        <div id="kugou-tracks" class="mt-space-sm flex max-h-[32rem] flex-col gap-1 overflow-y-auto"></div>
      </div>

      <form
        id="kugou-add-form"
        class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm rounded-xl border border-surface-container-high bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg shadow-sm"
      >
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">向当前歌单添加曲目</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          酷狗添加接口需要曲目 hash；名称、albumId、albumAudioId 可留空。添加后会自动刷新，并让站内歌单缓存失效。
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-space-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
          <label class="flex flex-col gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            hash *<input id="kugou-add-hash" class="field" required placeholder="32 位 hash" />
          </label>
          <label class="flex flex-col gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            歌名
            <input id="kugou-add-name" class="field" />
          </label>
          <label class="flex flex-col gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            albumId
            <input id="kugou-add-album" class="field" value="0" />
          </label>
          <label class="flex flex-col gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            albumAudioId
            <input id="kugou-add-audio" type="number" class="field" value="0" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-sm">
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="rounded-lg bg-primary px-space-lg py-2 font-label-md text-label-md text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-container"
          >
            添加
          </button>
          <span
            id="kugou-track-status"
            class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant"
            role="status"
            aria-live="polite"
          ></span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
